  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "시선이 무섭다고 생각해 보신 적 없나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC120C7740020BB34C12DB2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D5740020BCF4C2E00020C8010020C5C6B098C694003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무서울 때가 있죠",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C11CC6B80020B54CAC000020C788C8E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일 있어요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77C0020C788C5B4C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "힘을 빌려주셨으면 하는 일이 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D798C7440020BE4CB824C8FCC168C73CBA740020D558B2940020C77CC7740020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃집에 팔데아지방에서\n이사 온 분이 있는데요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3C9D1C5D00020D314B370C544C9C0BC29C5D0C11C000AC774C0AC0020C6280020BD84C7740020C788B294B370C694002E002E002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그분이 데리고 있는 포켓몬이<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8BD84C7740020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC77400100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 귀여운 핫삼을\n계속 뚫어지게 쳐다보지 뭐예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020ADC0C5ECC6B40020D56BC0BCC744000AACC4C18D0020B6ABC5B4C9C0AC8C0020CCD0B2E4BCF4C9C00020BB50C608C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 핫삼이 조금 겁쟁이라\n매일 벌벌 떨고 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D56BC0BCC7740020C870AE080020AC81C7C1C774B77C000AB9E4C77C0020BC8CBC8C0020B5A8ACE00020C788C5B4C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃집 포켓몬...\n벼리짱이 대체 무슨 생각으로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n핫삼을 쳐다보는 건지 확인해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3C9D10020D3ECCF13BAAC002E002E002E000ABCBCB9ACC9F1C7740020B300CCB40020BB34C2A80020C0DDAC01C73CB85C00100001BE00000AD56BC0BCC7440020CCD0B2E4BCF4B2940020AC74C9C00020D655C778D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하스...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C2A4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃분은 옥상에 계실 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3BD84C7400020C625C0C1C5D00020ACC4C2E40020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기...\n제게 무슨 볼일이 있으신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30002E002E002E000AC81CAC8C0020BB34C2A80020BCFCC77CC7740020C788C73CC2E0AC00C694003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벼리짱 때문에요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCBCB9ACC9F10020B54CBB38C5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핫삼 때문에요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56BC0BC0020B54CBB38C5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아! 이웃집 분의\n포켓몬 때문에 오신 거군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54400210020C774C6C3C9D10020BD84C758000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020B54CBB38C5D00020C624C2E00020AC70AD70C694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 벼리짱이 핫삼을\n뚫어지게 쳐다봤다는 건 사실이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020BCBCB9ACC9F1C7740020D56BC0BCC744000AB6ABC5B4C9C0AC8C0020CCD0B2E4BD24B2E4B2940020AC740020C0ACC2E4C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 이웃집 분의 핫삼의 눈빛이\n사납다고 해야 하나 무섭다고 해야 하나...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n경계하게 돼서 쳐다봤을 뿐이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C774C6C3C9D10020BD84C7580020D56BC0BCC7580020B208BE5BC774000AC0ACB0A9B2E4ACE00020D574C57C0020D558B0980020BB34C12DB2E4ACE00020D574C57C0020D558B098002E002E002E00100001BE00000AACBDACC4D558AC8C0020B3FCC11C0020CCD0B2E4BD24C7440020BFD0C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 그것뿐이지만 가만히 쳐다보면\n무서운 건 그쪽도 마찬가지겠죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020ADF8AC83BFD0C774C9C0B9CC0020AC00B9CCD7880020CCD0B2E4BCF4BA74000ABB34C11CC6B40020AC740020ADF8CABDB3C40020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C0ACA0C8E0003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님, 괜찮으시다면\n방금 제 말을 이웃분에게 전해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D8002C0020AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA74000ABC29AE080020C81C0020B9D0C7440020C774C6C3BD84C5D0AC8C0020C804D5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벼리...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCBCB9AC002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃집 벼리짱이\n쳐다보는 이유가 뭐라던가요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3C9D10020BCBCB9ACC9F1C774000ACCD0B2E4BCF4B2940020C774C720AC000020BB50B77CB358AC00C694003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핫삼의 눈빛 때문이래요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56BC0BCC7580020B208BE5B0020B54CBB38C774B798C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핫삼이 무섭대요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56BC0BCC7740020BB34C12DB300C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 핫삼의 눈빛이 무서워서\n도리어 핫삼을 쳐다본 거라니...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0020D56BC0BCC7580020B208BE5BC7740020BB34C11CC6CCC11C000AB3C4B9ACC5B40020D56BC0BCC7440020CCD0B2E4BCF80020AC70B77CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 핫삼을 경계했던 거라니...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0020D56BC0BCC7440020ACBDACC4D588B3580020AC70B77CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 미안한 일이지만\n핫삼은 원래 이런 눈빛이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020BBF8C548D55C0020C77CC774C9C0B9CC000AD56BC0BCC7400020C6D0B7980020C774B7F00020B208BE5BC774C5D0C694002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경계했을 뿐이라지만...\n가만히 쳐다보면 무섭잖아요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACBDACC4D588C7440020BFD0C774B77CC9C0B9CC002E002E002E000AAC00B9CCD7880020CCD0B2E4BCF4BA740020BB34C12DC796C544C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이사 온 지 얼마 되지도 않은\n모르는 사람과 포켓몬 때문에<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n평온한 일상을 빼앗겨 버리다니!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C0AC0020C6280020C9C00020C5BCB9C80020B418C9C0B3C40020C54AC740000ABAA8B974B2940020C0ACB78CACFC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020B54CBB38C5D000100001BE00000AD3C9C628D55C0020C77CC0C1C7440020BE7CC557ACA80020BC84B9ACB2E4B2C8002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 벼리짱은 금속을 모으기 위해\n다른 포켓몬을 공격한다고 들었어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n설마 핫삼이 강철타입이라서...?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020BCBCB9ACC9F1C7400020AE08C18DC7440020BAA8C73CAE300020C704D574000AB2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020ACF5ACA9D55CB2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4C694002E00100001BE01000AC124B9C80020D56BC0BCC7740020AC15CCA0D0C0C785C774B77CC11C002E002E002E003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핫...!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56B002E002E002E002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "걱정하지 마, 핫삼!\n무슨 일이 생기면 내가 지켜줄 테니까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC71C815D558C9C00020B9C8002C0020D56BC0BC0021000ABB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C0DDAE30BA740020B0B4AC000020C9C0CF1CC9040020D14CB2C8AE4C002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃분이 안심해도 될 사람인지 모르는 이상\n핫삼의 불안은 해소되지 않을 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3BD84C7740020C548C2ECD574B3C40020B4200020C0ACB78CC778C9C00020BAA8B974B2940020C774C0C1000AD56BC0BCC7580020BD88C548C7400020D574C18CB418C9C00020C54AC7440020AC70C608C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃분도 이제 막 이사 온 참이라\n경황이 없으실 테니<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n잘 전달해 주시면 감사하겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3BD84B3C40020C774C81C0020B9C90020C774C0AC0020C6280020CC38C774B77C000AACBDD669C7740020C5C6C73CC2E40020D14CB2C800100001BE00000AC7980020C804B2ECD5740020C8FCC2DCBA740020AC10C0ACD558ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핫...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56B002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이웃분께서는 뭐라고 하시던가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3BD84AED8C11CB2940020BB50B77CACE00020D558C2DCB358AC00C694003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쳐다보면 무섭대요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCD0B2E4BCF4BA740020BB34C12DB300C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벼리짱이 무섭대요",
