      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C6C3BD84AED8C11C0020B0AFC1200020B545C5D00020C640C11C000ABD88C548D5600020C77CC7740020B9CEC7400020AC740020C774D574D558C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE00000AC800B2940020C61BB0A0BD80D1300020C5ECAE30C5D00020C0B4C558C5C8B2E4AD6CC694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요!\n째려보지 않았다는 걸 증명해 보이죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
