      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020BCBCB9ACC9F1B3C40020ACBDACC4D558B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020C788C73CBA74000AC810C8100020C2A4D2B8B808C2A4B97C0020BC1BC7440020D14CB2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벼리짱이 핫삼을 공격하지 않는다는 걸\n증명해 보이겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCBCB9ACC9F1C7740020D56BC0BCC7440020ACF5ACA9D558C9C00020C54AB294B2E4B2940020AC78000AC99DBA85D5740020BCF4C774ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮지, 벼리짱?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
