      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020AC70B9ACAC000020AC00AE4CC6CCC9C40020AC830020AC19B124C694002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러게요. 미르에 온 지 얼마 안 돼서\n모르는 것투성이지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 일이 있을 때 도와주시면 감사하겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 4876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECAC8CC694002E0020BBF8B974C5D00020C6280020C9C00020C5BCB9C80020C5480020B3FCC11C000ABAA8B974B2940020AC83D22CC131C774C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C7440020B54C0020B3C4C640C8FCC2DCBA740020AC10C0ACD558ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님,\n오늘은 여러모로 감사했어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
